cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "OpenRouter Uptime: a git-versioned availability registry for OpenRouter models and endpoints"
abstract: >-
  A git-versioned archive of OpenRouter's self-reported availability for every
  model and routing endpoint on the platform, with endpoint-level identity.
  Raw API responses are archived verbatim as ground truth; derived tables, an
  incident log and a fail-closed audit are rebuilt from them. Polled every 15
  minutes by two independent schedulers since 2026-08-06, best-effort hourly
  from 2026-07-04 before that; measured sampling characteristics, including
  gaps, are published in status/coverage.json. Provider data-policy fields are
  null after 2026-07-15, when OpenRouter stopped publishing them; last-known
  values remain in the raw archives. Tidy tables are mirrored to HuggingFace
  and Kaggle.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Wenbin
    family-names: Wu
repository-code: "https://github.com/dthinkr/openrouter-uptime"
url: "https://github.com/dthinkr/openrouter-uptime"
keywords:
  - openrouter
  - large language models
  - uptime
  - infrastructure
  - AI governance
  - time series
